1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,955
And now the word every student gets wrong.

2
00:00:02,955 --> 00:00:04,674
Bark is not just the cork.

3
00:00:04,674 --> 00:00:14,453
Bark is everything outside the vascular cambium: the secondary phloem, the periderm, and whatever is left of the cortex and epidermis.

